Subject: [PATCH 05/34] Wildlife v1: hunting pressure, neglect spills, herds
 and predator packs

- sim_ground: hunted grounds yield less and recover daily; adventurers drift to quieter ones
- A ground near a town left unhunted for a week can spill a band onto the nearest road (camp + bounty)
- Herds graze between beast grounds; packs follow and prey on them by day, prowl the roads at night; both real creatures near the player, walking where the sim moves them
- .sim wildlife (GM)

